0E6 EQUATE P2       0E7 EQUATE P3        0E8 EQUATE P4         0E9 EQUATE P5
0EA EQUATE P6       0EB EQUATE P0CON     0EC EQUATE P0PUR      0ED EQUATE P0INT
0EE EQUATE P0EDGE   0EF EQUATE P1CON     0F0 EQUATE P1PUR      0F1 EQUATE P1INT   
0F2 EQUATE P1EDGE   0F3 EQUATE P2CON     0F4 EQUATE P2PUR      0F5 EQUATE P3CON
0F6 EQUATE P3PUR    0F7 EQUATE P3INT     0F8 EQUATE P3EDGE     0F9 EQUATE P4CONH
0FA EQUATE P4CONL   0FB EQUATE P5CONH    0FC EQUATE P5CONL     0FD EQUATE P6CON   
0FE EQUATE LMOD     0FF EQUATE TSTMOD3  

